      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 1,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "啊——啊——。/n红豆娘红红的，a i u e o。浮萍上——",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "1131",
      "BgmFileName": "203",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302100010",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030210002,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030210,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 2,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……差不多，那边也到半夜了吧。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302100020",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030210003,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030210,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 3,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "都该睡觉了还没睡吧？/n你们这群调皮鬼弟妹。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302100030",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030210004,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030210,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 4,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "看吧，被哥哥骂了。/n不过哥哥还打错字了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302100040",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030210005,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030210,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 5,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "呵呵。真像哥哥会用的呆呆贴图。/n都能想象他现在是什么表情。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302100050",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030210006,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030210,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 6,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……顺便告诉他们一声吧。/n「我拿到主演了」……发送。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302100060",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030210007,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030210,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 7,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "哦，已经显示已读了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302100070",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030210008,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030210,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 8,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "这就是所谓的贴图轰炸吗。/n真是拿他们没办法。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302100080",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030210009,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030210,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 9,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……偶尔也跟他们通个话吧。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302100090",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030210010,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030210,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 10,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "喂，你们几个，到底还要熬到几点。/n明天还要上学，不睡觉可不行哦～？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302100100",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030210011,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030210,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 11,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "嗯？主演？哼哼，没什么大不了的。/n直播票我会发给你们。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302100110",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030210012,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030210,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 12,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……嗯，不会让你们过苦日子的。/n我会赚很多钱。尽管期待吧。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302100120",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
